<title>SPAIN: Spain to sell 15-20 pct of Endesa in '97.</title>
<headline>Spain to sell 15-20 pct of Endesa in '97.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish government will sell a 15 to 20 percent stake in electricity firm Endesa on the stock market in fall of 1997, Industry Minister Josep Pique said at the weekend.</p>
<p>An additional tranche of about the same size would be sold under the privatisation programme in 1998 and the rest of the government's shares would be offered in 1999. The government currently holds 67 percent of the company.</p>
<p>+ Madrid Newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
